    <description>Sends an email notification to the Case Owner whenever a Case&apos;s Status field changes. Implements US-0012589. Snapshots the prior status onto Previous_Status__c before invoking the Case_Status_Change_Alert email alert, so the email template can merge both the old and new status. Fault paths capture errors without blocking the triggering Case save.</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
